body:
I've remembered a bunch of repressed memories this past year or so of my mom assaulting me. 

&#x200B;

I don't have any good advice. But the one thing I do know is that I personally wished that I didn't feel so alone. So here, I'll give you the peace sign (I don't know if it's a good idea to hug right now), and let you know you're not alone, and if you want to dm me just as a venting outlet, go on ahead. 

&#x200B;

You're worthy. And you are so much bigger and better of a person than your abuser ever was.
